From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: OneFeiFan <3022504358@qq.com>
Date: Sat, 31 Oct 2026 20:10:12 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] zram: use virtually contiguous compression stream buffers
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Replace the 2-page __get_free_pages() allocation with vzalloc()/vfree(). Per-CPU compression streams do not need physically contiguous pages, so allocation no longer fails under memory fragmentation.

Origin: Barry Song d4b079aee4 (via ESK android12-5.10-gki)

Co-Authored-By: Claude Code <noreply@anthropic.com>

Origin: ESK d4b079aee4（Barry Song）：zram 压缩流缓冲区改用 vzalloc，不再要求 2 页物理连续（旧 0032）
Upstream-Status: Backport（经 ESK）
KABI: none
Depends-On: none（作用于 0016 内建的 zram）
Notes: 旧 0032
Tested-On: r16（2026-11-01）：完整构建、KMI 门禁（7298 个导出符号，缺失 0，CRC 差异 0；670 个厂商模块 0 失败）、开机
---
 drivers/block/zram/zcomp.c | 10 ++++++----
 1 file changed, 6 insertions(+), 4 deletions(-)

diff --git a/drivers/block/zram/zcomp.c b/drivers/block/zram/zcomp.c
index 4d008b295..3080ed8a4 100644
--- a/drivers/block/zram/zcomp.c
+++ b/drivers/block/zram/zcomp.c
@@ -11,6 +11,7 @@
 #include <linux/sched.h>
 #include <linux/cpu.h>
 #include <linux/crypto.h>
+#include <linux/vmalloc.h>
 
 #include "zcomp.h"
 
@@ -49,7 +50,7 @@ static void zcomp_strm_free(struct zcomp_strm *zstrm)
 {
 	if (!IS_ERR_OR_NULL(zstrm->tfm))
 		crypto_free_comp(zstrm->tfm);
-	free_pages((unsigned long)zstrm->buffer, 1);
+	vfree(zstrm->buffer);
 	zstrm->tfm = NULL;
 	zstrm->buffer = NULL;
 }
@@ -62,10 +63,11 @@ static int zcomp_strm_init(struct zcomp_strm *zstrm, struct zcomp *comp)
 {
 	zstrm->tfm = crypto_alloc_comp(comp->name, 0, 0);
 	/*
-	 * allocate 2 pages. 1 for compressed data, plus 1 extra for the
-	 * case when compressed size is larger than the original one
+	 * allocate 2 virtually contiguous pages. 1 for compressed data,
+	 * plus 1 extra for the case when compressed size is larger than
+	 * the original one
 	 */
-	zstrm->buffer = (void *)__get_free_pages(GFP_KERNEL | __GFP_ZERO, 1);
+	zstrm->buffer = vzalloc(2 * PAGE_SIZE);
 	if (IS_ERR_OR_NULL(zstrm->tfm) || !zstrm->buffer) {
 		zcomp_strm_free(zstrm);
 		return -ENOMEM;
